    "Models with \"Keep model on disk\" switched on keep their disk while stopped, so the next start skips the download. RunPod charges 0.20 USD per GB and month for it; it is included in the figures above. Podlight deletes pods left unused for %lld days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modelle mit eingeschaltetem „Modell zwischenspeichern“ behalten ihre Festplatte im gestoppten Zustand, damit der nächste Start ohne Download auskommt. RunPod berechnet dafür 0,20 USD pro GB und Monat; das ist in den Zahlen oben enthalten. Podlight löscht Pods, die %lld Tage unbenutzt waren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move Podlight": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight verschieben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move Podlight to Applications?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight in den Programme-Ordner verschieben?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Applications": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Programme verschieben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name for agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name für Agenten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs a Hugging Face token": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Braucht einen Hugging-Face-Token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Netzwerk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Model…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neues Modell …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next steps": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nächste Schritte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next, add a model. Podlight checks whether it suits a coding agent, suggests a GPU and shows the cost per hour. Nothing is started or charged until you press Start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als Nächstes fügst du ein Modell hinzu. Podlight prüft, ob es sich für einen Coding-Agenten eignet, schlägt eine Karte vor und zeigt die Kosten pro Stunde. Gestartet und berechnet wird erst, wenn du auf „Starten“ klickst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No GGUF files found in this repository.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In diesem Repository gibt es keine GGUF-Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Models Yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Modelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No RunPod card can hold this model with its context. Choose a smaller context or a 4-bit variant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Karte bei RunPod fasst dieses Modell mit diesem Kontext. Wähle weniger Kontext oder eine 4-Bit-Variante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No answer: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Antwort: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No card at RunPod can hold this model right now. Try a 4-bit build, or allow more regions above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerade fasst keine Karte bei RunPod dieses Modell. Versuch eine 4-Bit-Variante oder erlaube oben mehr Regionen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No card can hold this model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Karte fasst dieses Modell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No free card at RunPod.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine freie Karte bei RunPod."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No free card combination holds %@ tokens right now. At most %@ tokens are possible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerade fasst keine freie Kartenkombination %1$@ Token. Möglich sind höchstens %2$@ Token."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "No free card combination holds %1$@ tokens right now. At most %2$@ tokens are possible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No weight files found in this repository.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In diesem Repository liegen keine Gewichte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No: coding agents will not work well": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nein, Coding-Agenten funktionieren damit schlecht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicht jetzt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not set": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicht eingetragen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not supported by this model": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kann dieses Modell nicht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing found. Try a shorter name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nichts gefunden. Versuche einen kürzeren Namen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is billed while the model is stopped. Each start downloads the model again, which takes 10–25 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solange das Modell gestoppt ist, wird nichts berechnet. Jeder Start lädt das Modell neu herunter, das dauert 10 bis 25 Minuten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is running": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nichts läuft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is running, so nothing is billed for GPUs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerade läuft nichts, für Karten wird also nichts berechnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jetzt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off · nothing billed while stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus · im gestoppten Zustand kostenlos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On · about %@ a month while stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An · etwa %@ pro Monat im gestoppten Zustand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only programs on this Mac can connect. Switch on the local network to use your models from a second computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur Programme auf diesem Mac können sich verbinden. Gib das lokale Netzwerk frei, um deine Modelle von einem zweiten Rechner aus zu nutzen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur dieser Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Folder in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner im Finder öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Podlight": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Podlight at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight bei der Anmeldung öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open RunPod Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod-Einstellungen öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open RunPod billing": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrechnung bei RunPod öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the model page": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modellseite öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenCode": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenCode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other computers connect with the address under Connection and the same key. The connection is not encrypted: use this only in networks you trust, not in public Wi-Fi. macOS may ask once whether Podlight may accept incoming connections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andere Rechner verbinden sich mit der Adresse unter „Verbindung“ und demselben Schlüssel. Die Verbindung ist nicht verschlüsselt: Nutze das nur in Netzen, denen du vertraust, nicht im öffentlichen WLAN. macOS fragt eventuell einmal, ob Podlight eingehende Verbindungen annehmen darf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overview": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Übersicht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste a new token": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neuen Token einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste into ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json (if the file has content, merge the \"providers\" entry), then pick podlight/<name> with /models.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json einfügen (steht schon etwas darin, nur den Eintrag „providers“ übernehmen), dann podlight/<Name> mit /models wählen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste into ~/.pi/agent/models.json (if the file has content, merge the \"providers\" entry), then pick the model with /model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In ~/.pi/agent/models.json einfügen (steht schon etwas darin, nur den Eintrag „providers“ übernehmen), dann das Modell mit /model wählen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API-Key einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the token (hf_…)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Token einfügen (hf_…)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per day": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro Tag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per month": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro Monat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight Help": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight-Hilfe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight could not be moved (%@). Drag it into Applications in the Finder instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight konnte nicht verschoben werden (%@). Zieh es stattdessen im Finder in den Programme-Ordner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight could not use the keychain: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight konnte den Schlüsselbund nicht verwenden: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight is connected to RunPod": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight ist mit RunPod verbunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight is running from the disk image or your Downloads folder. In Applications it starts reliably at login and updates itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight läuft aus dem Disk-Image oder deinem Download-Ordner. Im Programme-Ordner startet es zuverlässig bei der Anmeldung und aktualisiert sich selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight moves into the Applications folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight wandert in den Programme-Ordner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight needs your RunPod API key to start pods.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight braucht deinen RunPod-API-Key, um Pods zu starten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight needs your RunPod API key to start pods. It takes about a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight braucht deinen RunPod-API-Key, um Pods zu starten. Das dauert etwa eine Minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight auf GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight runs a language model of your choice on a rented GPU at RunPod, and lets the coding agent on this Mac use it, for example OpenCode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight startet ein Sprachmodell deiner Wahl auf einer gemieteten Grafikkarte bei RunPod. Dein Coding-Agent auf diesem Mac, etwa OpenCode, kann es dann nutzen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight: nothing running": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight: nichts läuft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Podlight: pods running": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight: Pods laufen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pods download models over addresses RunPod shares with other customers. Hugging Face limits downloads without an account more strictly, which can stop a download halfway.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pods laden Modelle über Adressen, die RunPod mit anderen Kunden teilt. Hugging Face begrenzt Downloads ohne Konto stärker, das kann einen Download mittendrin abbrechen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port %@ is not available. Another program may be using it; choose a different port in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port %@ ist nicht verfügbar. Vielleicht nutzt ihn ein anderes Programm. Wähle in den Einstellungen einen anderen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Price": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Price while running": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preis im Betrieb"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quantisation": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quantisierung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit and Keep Running": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beenden, Pods weiterlaufen lassen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reachable on the local network": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im lokalen Netzwerk erreichbar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reachable on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf diesem Mac erreichbar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading the model from Hugging Face…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lese das Modell von Hugging Face …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recommended: downloads are limited more strictly without one, and gated models need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empfohlen: Ohne Token begrenzt Hugging Face Downloads stärker, und gesperrte Modelle brauchen ihn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove Token": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Token entfernen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace API Key…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API-Key ersetzen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resuming takes about a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Fortsetzen dauert etwa eine Minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run Setup Again…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einrichtung erneut ausführen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run longer before it stops": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Länger laufen lassen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the first command in Terminal to use Claude Code with Podlight once, or add the function to ~/.zshrc and start it with claude-podlight. Plain claude keeps your normal login.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Führ den ersten Befehl im Terminal aus, um Claude Code einmal mit Podlight zu nutzen, oder füg die Funktion in ~/.zshrc ein und starte mit claude-podlight. Der normale Befehl claude behält deine übliche Anmeldung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod-API-Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod Console": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod-Konsole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod could not be reached (%@). Check the internet connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod ist nicht erreichbar (%@). Prüfe die Internetverbindung und versuche es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod did not accept the API key. Check it in Settings → Access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod hat den API-Key nicht angenommen. Prüfe ihn unter Einstellungen → Zugänge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod does not know this key. Check that it was copied completely, or create a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod kennt diesen Key nicht. Prüfe, ob er vollständig kopiert ist, oder lege einen neuen an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod has no free card right now (tried: %@). Try again in a few minutes, or choose \"Fast\" for more card types.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod hat gerade keine freie Karte (versucht: %@). Versuche es in ein paar Minuten noch einmal oder wähle „Schnell“, dann kommen mehr Kartentypen in Frage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod placed the pod outside your chosen region, so Podlight deleted it straight away. Try again, or allow more regions under Edit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod hat den Pod außerhalb deiner Region angelegt, deshalb hat Podlight ihn sofort gelöscht. Versuch es noch einmal oder erlaube unter „Bearbeiten“ mehr Regionen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod refused (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod hat abgelehnt (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod refused: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunPod hat abgelehnt: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RunPod reported an error.": {
      "localizations": {
